27
00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:52.099
Include clean, random-noise, known-vulnerable, attack-aware, transfer,

28
00:01:52.099 --> 00:01:58.418
and adaptive controls; preserve query and tuning budgets; and report robustness with

29
00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:02.631
clean utility, false positives, recovery, latency, and residuals.

30
00:02:02.631 --> 00:02:07.370
No result transfers automatically to frontier models or production.

31
00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:11.958
Maintain separate evasion, poisoning, backdoor, safeguard-bypass, extraction,

32
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:16.813
